  "basis": "The former standalone monument node5308041631 was incorporated into way1549061397 on2026-08-12, explaining why a node lookup and building-only neighborhood search did not resolve the footprint. The way identifies en:Vijaya_Stambha and37.19m height. Its small5.8×5.6m rectangular outline represents the upper roof rather than the14.32m support terrace. Its center supplies the landmark anchor and its north edge fixes the near-cardinal axis; the primary ASI plan establishes which side is the south entrance. The model retains independently documented lower shaft and terrace dimensions instead of shrinking them to this roof outline.",
